WEBVTT

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.750
<i>Escape</i>

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.920
<i>On this wind,</i>

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.630
<i>I let my tears ride</i>

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.800
<i>Speeding up until they dry</i>

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.520
<i>I can fly over and go on</i>

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:23.270
<i>I just know that the answer</i>

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:30.570
<i>Is out there, on the far side of that distant sky</i>

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:38.120
<i>In this place, where I can't find the answer</i>

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:43.410
<i>I sigh and look at the sky</i>

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:48.880
<i>Shining deep in these eyes suffused in blue</i>

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:51.760
<i>Is a dreamer, who can go anywhere</i>

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.130
<i>That's me, you see</i>

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.800
<i>Escape</i>

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:57.800
<i>On this wind,</i>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.600
<i>I let my wish ride</i>

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:04.850
<i>My outstretched hands paint the future</i>

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.480
<i>I'm not afraid anymore</i>

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.280
<i>Of the trace of tears</i>

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:16.860
<i>Suffused in rainbow colors, I fly on</i>

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:25.420
<i>To the far side of that sky</i>

00:22:10.950 --> 00:22:12.160
"Iwato Island Westernmost Point"

00:23:55.390 --> 00:23:58.680
"To Be Continued"

00:24:01.020 --> 00:24:05.400
<i>The pounding beat of my heart</i>

00:24:06.900 --> 00:24:12.360
<i>Had become a familiar part</i>

00:24:06.900 --> 00:24:12.360
<i>of me before I knew it</i>

00:24:12.610 --> 00:24:18.290
<i>Even if there's a stiff wind blowing</i>

00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:24.420
<i>I'll always be looking ahead, eyes wide open</i>

00:24:24.670 --> 00:24:32.010
<i>If you ever feel like crying, remember</i>

00:24:32.260 --> 00:24:38.060
<i>The promise we silently swore to one another</i>

00:24:38.310 --> 00:24:44.100
<i>The song of a fledgling taking wing</i>

00:24:44.350 --> 00:24:49.690
<i>Even now, still unable to fly well</i>

00:24:49.940 --> 00:24:55.700
<i>But over time that comes and goes</i>

00:24:55.950 --> 00:24:57.910
<i>Single-mindedly</i>

00:24:58.160 --> 00:25:01.250
<i>Following those joined hands</i>

00:25:01.500 --> 00:25:07.250
<i>"So I never let you go!!" Those words</i>

00:25:07.500 --> 00:25:12.920
<i>Even if they only vanish into the sky</i>

00:25:13.170 --> 00:25:18.970
<i>Inside the scattering lights</i>

00:25:19.220 --> 00:25:21.100
<i>Unwaveringly</i>

00:25:21.350 --> 00:25:26.690
<i>I know I can find you</i>

00:25:28.980 --> 00:25:32.780
"Preview"
